    "problem": [
      {
        "text": "The architecture registry had an unsorted model list, and Gemma3's preprocessing comment omitted the batch dimension already added by the code.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_732ff72aa40b48c2910befdd064d5f4d",
          "call_caa349a585294dba927bce2ef02b2f1e"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "reasoning": [
      {
        "text": "The cleanup reorders existing imports and registry entries without adding or removing models. The Gemma3 edit corrects documentation rather than changing tensor construction.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_732ff72aa40b48c2910befdd064d5f4d",
          "call_caa349a585294dba927bce2ef02b2f1e"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "impact": [
      {
        "text": "Registry iteration order changes, but the inspected configuration loader selects entries by architecture string, not position. The declared architecture strings are distinct, so the reorder does not introduce a duplicate-key overwrite.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_553297f1cb284dabbb4299879518f635",
          "call_95b45d933afc48efb2af48eecbe4faea",
          "call_637f21c56cf44f82b08be112ae235eae"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "source_notes": [
      {
        "text": "The Gemma3 vision introduction entry establishes that preprocessing already produced a half-precision tensor with a leading batch dimension. The Mistral3 introduction entry establishes the registry addition retained by this cleanup.",
        "basis": "ancestor",
        "evidence": [
          "call_ce4dd66a2d484f72b79ab24b4f4bfe13",
          "call_70d307b07126468daaa77fd8fc8804bf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Issue #7, \u201cquantizing model: undefined symbol: __cxa_call_terminate,\u201d reports a native-extension import failure and a reporter-provided environment workaround. Its connection to this inspection is only an inferred shared config.py path; it does not establish a problem addressed by this cleanup.",
        "basis": "inference",
        "evidence": [
          "call_2dbc435199dd444c8089931f1cd037e0",
          "call_95b45d933afc48efb2af48eecbe4faea"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Import-order side effects and model execution were not tested.",
      "No numerical algorithm changes here warrant a scalar computation; tensor-shape reasoning is source inspection, not execution."
    ],
    "links": [
